<title>FRANCE: Ciments Francais H1 profit slips.</title>
<headline>Ciments Francais H1 profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable				36  vs		51</p>
<p>    Operating					748  vs	     881</p>
<p>    Cashflow					 718  vs	     827</p>
<p>    Turnover				     5,819  vs	   6,215</p>
<p>NOTE - Ciments Francais, a unit of Italcementi, gave its results in a statement. It said the fall in turnover was due to poor weather conditions in the first quarter. There was also a sharp drop in activity in European Union countries. Operating profits were down 15 percent, with investment levels practically unchanged. Financial charges fell 24 percent due to a reduction in average debt and a big drop in interest rates in European markets.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
